Explanation

- The `create.end` event is also fired for pasted shapes, and since tasks are one of our “direct‐editable” types, the first pasted task will trigger an unwanted edit session.
- By checking `event.context.paste` we distinguish “real” user‐driven creates from clipboard‐paste creates and bail out early, thus stopping direct‐editing from activating on paste.
